                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f6e0d435-9187-4593-84dd-89a10c6e0d3c",
                        "source_entry_id": "01cd50eb-7434-3f06-8ecf-b414d86d43e3",
                        "source_sense_id": "e12e5f60-9b17-3d32-ac43-ec7b4bf9b352",
                        "target_lang_word": "antithesis",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "antithesis",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d00d0b1f-1a81-3035-82aa-4e3ed2cad6d7",
                                        "entry_id": "bd278417-02ad-3012-b580-0a84675a1e7e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A proposition that is the diametric opposite of some other proposition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a350d63-fcd6-4a2e-9dc5-453ba0ac23cb",
                                                "sense_id": "d00d0b1f-1a81-3035-82aa-4e3ed2cad6d7",
                                                "text": "Unless one final Schlafly paradox gets in the way. Before she died, the First Lady of the Conservative Movement endorsed Trump. That makes sense: Schlafly was a paleoconservative who was worried about immigration. But Trump has turned out to be the most unchivalrous candidate in living memory, the very antithesis of Schlafly’s ideal Christian standard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b66e585-c46e-493b-a886-7575461ad0f7",
                                                "sense_id": "d00d0b1f-1a81-3035-82aa-4e3ed2cad6d7",
                                                "text": "On the night of the 2nd of March 2025, your actions were the antithesis of everything Paddington stands for."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f8f20917-993a-3bef-985b-0ad28dbd4491",
                                        "entry_id": "bd278417-02ad-3012-b580-0a84675a1e7e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device by which two contrasting ideas are juxtaposed in parallel form; a figure of speech arranged in this manner"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rhetoric"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8f7338f-22c6-4fd0-95dc-32c58681b611",
                                                "sense_id": "f8f20917-993a-3bef-985b-0ad28dbd4491",
                                                "text": "Antithesis, opposing things to things,\nOft from the contrast strength and beauty brings."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "afbab2f1-e308-3ce5-9b89-4ee724956d54",
                                        "entry_id": "bd278417-02ad-3012-b580-0a84675a1e7e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The second stage of a dialectical process in which the thesis is negated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "02558c7c-a228-4344-9435-c2c12f11ab89",
                        "source_entry_id": "01cd50eb-7434-3f06-8ecf-b414d86d43e3",
                        "source_sense_id": "e12e5f60-9b17-3d32-ac43-ec7b4bf9b352",
                        "target_lang_word": "antithèse",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "antithèse",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03768dbd-674a-33ad-bfa5-921946683a80",
                                        "entry_id": "06fc8fbe-564e-3772-a261-5d08f4b903b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Figure par laquelle on oppose, dans un discours, des choses contraires les unes aux autres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rhetoric"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9831e947-7eb5-4b4a-8b2a-13ebfc8acde8",
                                                "sense_id": "03768dbd-674a-33ad-bfa5-921946683a80",
                                                "text": "Une noce au presbytère! Jamais mots ne furent moins faits pour être accolés. On voit là une antithèse qui sentirait l’huile si elle n’était amenée naturellement par la force des circonstances."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d477594-f488-4205-a764-62d3a1f323ac",
                                                "sense_id": "03768dbd-674a-33ad-bfa5-921946683a80",
                                                "text": "Elle habitait au-dessus d’une boucherie qui s’appelait, sans que personne eût jamais relevé la lugubre antithèse : Boucherie de la Gaîté."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd1272e6-0b2d-451a-b9da-8b13125b7892",
                                                "sense_id": "03768dbd-674a-33ad-bfa5-921946683a80",
                                                "text": "Henri eut un petit rire. Il se souvint tout à coup d’une vieille chronique où il avait, pour flétrir, stigmatiser, juvénaliser les comportements bourgeois, accumulé des bataillons d’imprécations pétaradantes, de prosopopées incendiaires, d’antithèses fulgurantes […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa4ef4b8-7517-3abb-bf39-11e8261b738c",
                                        "entry_id": "06fc8fbe-564e-3772-a261-5d08f4b903b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Proposition contraire à une proposition énoncée qu’on appelle thèse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15813bee-66ce-4c94-9635-48fae452a3d3",
                                                "sense_id": "aa4ef4b8-7517-3abb-bf39-11e8261b738c",
                                                "text": "Soutenir la thèse et l’antithèse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20d60fb5-b28f-3b0b-8801-8f2316e67018",
                                        "entry_id": "06fc8fbe-564e-3772-a261-5d08f4b903b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne ou chose faisant contraste avec une autre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb4a715b-2620-4c53-98e1-78c8a051c9bf",
                                                "sense_id": "20d60fb5-b28f-3b0b-8801-8f2316e67018",
                                                "text": "Le professeur Potain était l’antithèse vivante de Charcot. Il aimait les hommes d’un cœur ardent, infatigable, et il voyait surtout dans son art un moyen de les secourir."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "991c7908-d830-4d84-83c5-0d665015a66a",
                                                "sense_id": "20d60fb5-b28f-3b0b-8801-8f2316e67018",
                                                "text": "Kerry, c'est l'antithèse de Bush."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
